---
// Team: heading plus a four-column grid of eight people.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Our team</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">A small team, on purpose</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Halcyon is built by twenty-two people across six time zones. We work four-day weeks, write things down, and use our own product to plan every release.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-1.svg" alt="Portrait of Elena Vasquez" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Elena Vasquez</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Co-founder and CEO</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-2.svg" alt="Portrait of Jonas Lindqvist" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Jonas Lindqvist</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Co-founder and CTO</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-3.svg" alt="Portrait of Naomi Okafor" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Naomi Okafor</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Head of Design</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-4.svg" alt="Portrait of Hiro Tanaka" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Hiro Tanaka</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Principal Engineer</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-5.svg" alt="Portrait of Clara Whitfield" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Clara Whitfield</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Head of Customer Success</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-6.svg" alt="Portrait of Samir Patel" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Samir Patel</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Product Manager</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-7.svg" alt="Portrait of Maya Goldberg" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Maya Goldberg</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Senior Product Designer</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/media/avatar-8.svg" alt="Portrait of Luca Moretti" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-card border border-line bg-surface object-cover" />
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Luca Moretti</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Developer Advocate</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
